<h1 id="the-silq-programming-language">The Silq programming language</h1>
<p>A high-level programming language for quantum computing.</p>
<p><strong>Evolution:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>2010: Custom D compiler frontend as a hobby project</li>
<li>2015: Forked D compiler frontend for the PSI language</li>
<li>2018: Forked PSI to create Silq</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h1 id="silq-synopsis">Silq: Synopsis</h1>
<pre class="silq-code-window"><code class="language-silq">def bernstein_vazirani[n:!ℕ](const f: 𝔹^n !→lifted 𝔹){
	xs := [H(0) for _ in 0..n];
	if f(xs) { phase(π); }
	return measure([H(x) for x in xs]);
}

def f(const xs:𝔹^5){
	bs := [0,1,0,1,1];
	r := 0;
	for i in 0..5{
		r ⊕= bs[i]·xs[i];
	}
	return r;
}

def main() =&gt; assert(bernstein_vazirani(f) == [0,1,0,1,1]);</code></pre><hr>
<h1 id="d-vs-silq-selection">D vs Silq (selection)</h1>
<table>
 <thead>
 <tr>
 <th>Construct</th>
 <th style="text-align: center">D</th>
 <th style="text-align: center">Silq</th>
 </tr>
 </thead>
 <tbody>
 <tr>
 <td>Concatenation</td>
 <td style="text-align: center"><code class="code-inline language-d">a <span style="color:#ff79c6">~</span> b</code></td>
 <td style="text-align: center"><code class="language-silq">a ~ b</code>
</td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
 <td>Power</td>
 <td style="text-align: center"><code class="code-inline language-d">a <span style="color:#ff79c6">^^</span> b</code></td>
 <td style="text-align: center"><code class="language-silq">a ^ b</code>
</td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
 <td>Xor</td>
 <td style="text-align: center"><code class="code-inline language-d">a <span style="color:#ff79c6">^</span> b</code></td>
 <td style="text-align: center"><code class="language-silq">a xor b</code>
 / <code class="language-silq">a ⊻ b</code>
</td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
 <td>Bitwise Xor</td>
 <td style="text-align: center"><code class="code-inline language-d">a <span style="color:#ff79c6">^</span> b</code></td>
 <td style="text-align: center"><code class="language-silq">a xorb b</code>
 / <code class="language-silq">a ⊕ b</code>
</td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
 <td>Declaration</td>
 <td style="text-align: center"><code class="code-inline language-d"><span style="color:#8be9fd;font-style:italic">auto</span> a <span style="color:#ff79c6">=</span> b</code></td>
 <td style="text-align: center"><code class="language-silq">a := b</code>
</td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
 <td>Ternary expr.</td>
 <td style="text-align: center"><code class="code-inline language-d">c <span style="color:#ff79c6">?</span> a <span style="color:#ff79c6">:</span> b</code></td>
 <td style="text-align: center"><code class="language-silq">if a then b else c</code>
</td>
 </tr>
 </tbody>
</table>
